      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LITTLE DAN (1) boasts a strong record this journey here with six wins and five minors from 13 tries. Missed the frame latest (20.55) when seventh over 340m at this track in a Free For All. Makes strong appeal on best. FISHING YARI (2) was in the placings last time but shapes well for this on her slick win the start prior, getting around this track over 340m in 19.42. Should be in this for a long way. JUNGLE BOOGIE (8) is a promising dog in the frame at 23 of 60 starts including 18 wins and was a last start winner (19.51) over 340m at this track. Form here at the trip sound including three wins. Meets a moderate line up and should run well. WHISKY BARREL (3) is always hard to beat when he races here at this trip.",
